BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stimuleringsfonds-videotage-residency-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T150309Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261022
SUMMARY:Deadline: Stimuleringsfonds: Open Call Residency Videotage 2027 (Ho
 ng Kong)
DESCRIPTION:The Creative Industries Fund NL (Stimuleringsfonds) runs this r
 esidency with Videotage\, a Hong Kong-based non-profit media arts institut
 ion specialising in the promotion\, presentation\, creation and preservati
 on of moving image and media art in all forms and languages.\n\nOrganisati
 on: Stimuleringsfonds Creatieve Industrie (Creative Industries Fund NL) in
  collaboration with Videotage\, Hong Kong\nLocation: Residency takes place
  at Videotage in Hong Kong. Applicants must be established in the Netherla
 nds\, Aruba\, Bonaire\, Curacao\, Saba\, Sint Eustatius or Sint Maarten (K
 ingdom of the Netherlands) and registered in a business register within th
 e Kingdom of the Netherlands.\nAward: EUR 5\,000 for a two-month residency
  or EUR 6\,500 for a three-month residency\, paid by the Creative Industri
 es Fund NL to cover travel\, insurance\, living expenses\, compensation fo
 r time invested\, and material and transport costs. Accommodation\, use of
  the studio space and facilitation by Videotage are covered directly by th
 e Fund on top of this. No application fee.\nDuration: Two or three months 
 in 2027 (spring 2027)\; state your preferred period in the application.\n\
 nMore: https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/open-call-videotage?utm_
 source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/open-call-videotage?utm_sour
 ce=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Residency takes place at Videotage in Hong Kong. Applicants must b
 e established in the Netherlands\, Aruba\, Bonaire\, Curacao\, Saba\, Sint
  Eustatius or Sint Maarten (Kingdom of the Netherlands) and registered in 
 a business register within the Kingdom of the Netherlands.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stimuleringsfonds-jatiwangi-residency-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T150309Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261022
SUMMARY:Deadline: Stimuleringsfonds: Open Call Residency Jatiwangi art Fact
 ory 2027 (Indonesia)
DESCRIPTION:The Creative Industries Fund NL (Stimuleringsfonds) is recruiti
 ng one Netherlands-based designer\, architect or spatial practitioner for 
 a two-month residency in 2027 at Jatiwangi art Factory (JaF)\, an internat
 ionally recognised artistic collective based in a former roof tile factory
  in West Java\, Indonesia.\n\nOrganisation: Stimuleringsfonds Creatieve In
 dustrie (Creative Industries Fund NL) in collaboration with Jatiwangi art 
 Factory\, Indonesia\nLocation: Residency takes place at Jatiwangi art Fact
 ory in Jatiwangi\, West Java\, Indonesia. Applicants must be established i
 n the Netherlands\, Aruba\, Bonaire\, Curacao\, Saba\, Sint Eustatius or S
 int Maarten (Kingdom of the Netherlands) and registered in a business regi
 ster within the Kingdom of the Netherlands.\nAward: EUR 4\,500 subsidy for
  a two-month residency\, paid by the Creative Industries Fund NL. Accommod
 ation at Jatiwangi art Factory is provided: a small private container hous
 e furnished with two single beds and a bathroom/toilet. No application fee
 .\nDuration: Two months in 2027\n\nMore: https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/
 en/grants/open-call-residency-jatiwangi-art-factory?utm_source=artificialn
 ouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/open-call-residency-jatiwang
 i-art-factory?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Residency takes place at Jatiwangi art Factory in Jatiwangi\, West
  Java\, Indonesia. Applicants must be established in the Netherlands\, Aru
 ba\, Bonaire\, Curacao\, Saba\, Sint Eustatius or Sint Maarten (Kingdom of
  the Netherlands) and registered in a business register within the Kingdom
  of the Netherlands.
END:VEVENT
BEGIN:VEVENT
UID:stimuleringsfonds-suriname-residency-2027@artificialnouveau.github.io
DTSTAMP:20261104T150309Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261021
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261022
SUMMARY:Deadline: Stimuleringsfonds: Open Call Residency Suriname 2027 (Par
 amaribo\, Moengo\, Frederiksdorp)
DESCRIPTION:The Creative Industries Fund NL (Stimuleringsfonds) is recruiti
 ng one Netherlands-based designer\, architect or interdisciplinary maker f
 or a three-month residency in 2027 across three locations in Suriname: Par
 amaribo\, Moengo and Frederiksdorp\, each with its own cultural\, historic
 al and social context.\n\nOrganisation: Stimuleringsfonds Creatieve Indust
 rie (Creative Industries Fund NL) with local partner organisations in Suri
 name\nLocation: Residency takes place at three locations in Suriname: Para
 maribo\, Moengo and Frederiksdorp. Applicants must be established in the N
 etherlands\, Aruba\, Bonaire\, Curacao\, Saba\, Sint Eustatius or Sint Maa
 rten (Kingdom of the Netherlands) and registered in a business register wi
 thin the Kingdom of the Netherlands.\nAward: EUR 8\,500 subsidy for a thre
 e-month residency\, paid by the Creative Industries Fund NL. One residency
  position is awarded. No application fee.\nDuration: Three months in 2027\
 , moving between Paramaribo\, Moengo and Frederiksdorp\n\nMore: https://ww
 w.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/open-call-residency-suriname?utm_source=a
 rtificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
URL:https://www.stimuleringsfonds.nl/en/grants/open-call-residency-suriname
 ?utm_source=artificialnouveaugrantdesk&utm_medium=referral
LOCATION:Residency takes place at three locations in Suriname: Paramaribo\,
  Moengo and Frederiksdorp. Applicants must be established in the Netherlan
 ds\, Aruba\, Bonaire\, Curacao\, Saba\, Sint Eustatius or Sint Maarten (Ki
 ngdom of the Netherlands) and registered in a business register within the
  Kingdom of the Netherlands.
END:VEVENT
